    IF NOT (`the person is charged with an offence under subsection (2)`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a person charged with an offence under subsection (2)"
    ELSE IF `the person proves that he took all reasonable steps for securing that the resolution was put to the vote of the meeting`
